  "title": "缓存是什么：从一次请求说起",
  "order": 1,
  "content": {
    "type": "interactive",
    "widgetType": "tutorial",
    "description": "课程首页：图文排版讲清 HTTP 缓存是什么、为什么重要；嵌入式小交互为强缓存/协商缓存折叠面板与 Cache-Control 指令速查卡。",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<title>缓存是什么：从一次请求说起</title>\n<style>\n  /* 针对 1280x720 逻辑视口设计，宿主用 transform: scale() 适配 */\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { width: 1280px; height: 720px; overflow: hidden;\n         font-family: -apple-system, \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n         background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f6f4ee 0%, #eef2ec 100%); color: #2c2a26; }\n  .page { width: 1280px; height: 720px; padding: 36px 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  header { margin-bottom: 22px; }\n  .eyebrow { font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #5b7a5e; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 8px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 34px; line-height: 1.25; }\n  h1 em { font-style: normal; color: #5b7a5e; }\n  .sub { margin-top: 8px; font-size: 15px; color: #8a857c; }\n  .cols { flex: 1; display: flex; gap: 32px; min-height: 0; }\n  .col-left { flex: 7; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }\n  .col-right { flex: 5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }\n\n  .lead { background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 22px;\n          box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(44,42,38,.06); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; }\n  .lead b { color: #5b7a5e; }\n  .why { display: flex; gap: 12px; }\n  .why .card { flex: 1; background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\n               box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(44,42,38,.06); }\n  .why .icon { font-size: 22px; margin-bottom: 6px; }\n  .why b { display: block; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .why p { font-size: 12.5px; color: #6f6a60; line-height: 1.7; }\n\n  /* 折叠面板：嵌入式小交互 */\n  details.panel { background: #fff; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(44,42,38,.06);\n                  overflow: hidden; }\n  details.panel summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: 13px 18px;\n                          font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; }\n  details.panel summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n  details.panel summary::before { content: \"▸\"; color: #5b7a5e; margin-right: 8px;\n                                  transition: transform .2s; }\n  details.panel[open] summary::before { transform: rotate(90deg); }\n  details.panel .body { padding: 0 18px 14px 44px; font-size: 13.5px; color: #55504a;\n                        line-height: 1.8; }\n  details.panel code { background: #eef2ec; border-radius: 4px; padding: 1px 6px;\n                       font-family: \"SF Mono\", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }\n\n  /* Cache-Control 速查卡：点击切换指令 */\n  .cheat { flex: 1; background: #fff; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px 20px;\n           box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(44,42,38,.06); display: flex; flex-direction: column; }\n  .cheat h2 { font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 4px; }\n  .cheat .hint { font-size: 12px; color: #8a857c; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .tab { border: 1px solid #d8d3c8; background: #f9f7f2; border-radius: 999px;\n         padding: 6px 14px; font-size: 13px; cursor: pointer; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Consolas, monospace; }\n  .tab.active { background: #5b7a5e; color: #fff; border-color: #5b7a5e; }\n  .directive-card { flex: 1; background: #f6f4ee; border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; }\n  .directive-card .sig { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Consolas, monospace; font-size: 14px;\n                         color: #2c2a26; background: #eef2ec; border-radius: 6px;\n                         padding: 8px 12px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 10px; }\n  .directive-card .desc { font-size: 13.5px; line-height: 1.85; color: #55504a; }\n  .directive-card .scene-tag { display: inline-block; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px;\n                               background: #e9efe7; color: #4d6b50; border-radius: 999px;\n                               padding: 3px 12px; }\n  footer { margin-top: 16px; font-size: 12px; color: #a39e93; text-align: center; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <header>\n    <div class=\"eyebrow\">HTTP 缓存机制 · 第 1 节</div>\n    <h1>缓存是什么：从<em>一次请求</em>说起</h1>\n    <p class=\"sub\">理解「浏览器把响应存一份在本地」这件小事，如何省下大流量</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"cols\">\n    <div class=\"col-left\">\n      <div class=\"lead\">\n        你第一次打开一个网站时，浏览器要把 HTML、CSS、JS、图片全部从服务器下载下来。\n        而当你<b>第二次</b>打开时，页面却几乎是瞬间出现的——因为浏览器把大部分资源\n        <b>缓存（Cache）</b>在了本地：一份存在磁盘或内存里的副本。下次需要同一份资源时，\n        先翻翻「本地仓库」，有货且没过保质期就直接用，<b>一次网络往返都不需要</b>。\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"why\">\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">⚡</div><b>更快</b><p>命中缓存时零网络往返，页面加载从秒级降到毫秒级。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">📉</div><b>省流量</b><p>重复资源不再下载，移动端用户的流量账单直接受益。</p></div>\n        <div class=\"card\"><div class=\"icon\">🛡️</div><b>减负载</b><p>源服务器少处理海量重复请求，抗压能力显著提升。</p></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <details class=\"panel\" open>\n        <summary>强缓存（Freshness）：没过保质期，直接用</summary>\n        <div class=\"body\">\n          响应头 <code>Cache-Control: max-age=3600</code> 表示这份副本「保鲜 1 小时」。\n          保鲜期内再次请求同一资源，浏览器直接读本地副本，<b>不发任何请求</b>。\n          过期（stale）之后才需要找服务器「问一问」。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n\n      <details class=\"panel\">\n        <summary>协商缓存（Validation）：过期了，带凭证去验证</summary>\n        <div class=\"body\">\n          服务器给副本发一张「身份证」——<code>ETag</code>。副本过期后，浏览器带上\n          <code>If-None-Match</code> 发一个条件请求：没变？服务器回\n          <code>304 Not Modified</code>（不带响应体，极省流量），副本继续用；\n          变了？返回 <code>200 OK</code> 和新内容。\n        </div>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"col-right\">\n      <div class=\"cheat\">\n        <h2>Cache-Control 速查卡</h2>\n        <div class=\"hint\">点击指令，查看语义与适用场景</div>\n        <div class=\"tabs\" id=\"directive-tabs\">\n          <button class=\"tab active\" data-key=\"maxage\">max-age</button>\n          <button class=\"tab\" data-key=\"nocache\">no-cache</button>\n          <button class=\"tab\" data-key=\"nostore\">no-store</button>\n          <button class=\"tab\" data-key=\"immutable\">immutable</button>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"directive-card\" id=\"directive-card\">\n          <div class=\"sig\" id=\"directive-sig\"></div>\n          <div class=\"desc\" id=\"directive-desc\"></div>\n          <span class=\"scene-tag\" id=\"directive-scene\"></span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <footer>下一节：动手模拟强缓存与协商缓存的请求走向 →</footer>\n</div>\n\n<script type=\"application/json\" id=\"widget-config\">\n{\"type\": \"tutorial\", \"sections\": [\"是什么\", \"为什么\", \"速查卡\"], \"interactions\": [\"details-panel\", \"directive-tabs\"]}\n</script>\n\n<script>\n/* 速查卡数据：指令语义与适用场景（内容摘自课程材料 materials/http-caching.md） */\nvar DIRECTIVES = {\n  maxage: {\n    sig: \"Cache-Control: max-age=3600\",\n    desc: \"声明副本的「新鲜期」（秒）。新鲜期内浏览器直接使用本地副本，完全不发网络请求；过期后进入协商验证阶段。\",\n    scene: \"适用：带内容指纹的静态资源（app.a1b2c3.js）\"\n  },\n  nocache: {\n    sig: \"Cache-Control: no-cache\",\n    desc: \"不是「不许缓存」！副本可以存，但每次使用前都必须带 ETag 向服务器验证一次，拿到 304 才能用——缓存了，但不敢擅自用。\",\n    scene: \"适用：HTML 入口文件，保证用户拿到最新版本\"\n  },\n  nostore: {\n    sig: \"Cache-Control: no-store\",\n    desc: \"最严格的指令：任何缓存（浏览器、CDN、代理）都不许保存这份响应。每次访问都必须完整下载。\",\n    scene: \"适用：含敏感信息的响应（账户数据、交易页面）\"\n  },\n  immutable: {\n    sig: \"Cache-Control: max-age=31536000, immutable\",\n    desc: \"向浏览器承诺「内容永远不变」，连刷新页面都不再发起验证请求。必须与内容指纹文件名配套使用，否则更新后用户拿不到新版。\",\n    scene: \"适用：构建产物（带 hash 的 CSS/JS  bundles）\"\n  }\n};\nfunction showDirective(key) {\n  var d = DIRECTIVES[key];\n  document.getElementById(\"directive-sig\").textContent = d.sig;\n  document.getElementById(\"directive-desc\").textContent = d.desc;\n  document.getElementById(\"directive-scene\").textContent = d.scene;\n}\ndocument.getElementById(\"directive-tabs\").addEventListener(\"click\", function (e) {\n  var tab = e.target.closest(\".tab\");\n  if (!tab) return;\n  this.querySelectorAll(\".tab\").forEach(function (t) { t.classList.remove(\"active\"); });\n  tab.classList.add(\"active\");\n  showDirective(tab.dataset.key);\n});\nshowDirective(\"maxage\");\n\n/* ===== postMessage 桥：监听宿主下发的导览消息（参考 widget-contract.md） ===== */\nwindow.addEventListener('message', function (event) {\n  /* 宿主消息形如 {type:'HIGHLIGHT_ELEMENT', target:'#directive-tabs', content:'…', state:{…}} */\n  var data = event.data || {};\n  var type = data.type;\n  var target = data.target;\n  var content = data.content;\n  var state = data.state;\n  switch (type) {\n    case 'SET_WIDGET_STATE':\n      if (state) {\n        Object.keys(state).forEach(function (key) {\n          var el = document.getElementById(key + '-slider') ||\n                   document.querySelector('[data-var=\"' + key + '\"]');\n          if (el) {\n            el.value = state[key];\n            el.dispatchEvent(new Event('input', { bubbles: true }));\n          }\n        });\n      }\n      break;\n    case 'HIGHLIGHT_ELEMENT':\n      var highlightEl = document.querySelector(target);\n      if (highlightEl) {\n        highlightEl.style.outline = '3px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.8)';\n        highlightEl.style.outlineOffset = '4px';\n        highlightEl.style.animation = 'pulse-highlight 2s infinite';\n        setTimeout(function () {\n          highlightEl.style.outline = '';\n          highlightEl.style.animation = '';\n        }, 3000);\n      }\n      break;\n    case 'ANNOTATE_ELEMENT':\n      var annotateEl = document.querySelector(target);\n      if (annotateEl && content) {\n        var rect = annotateEl.getBoundingClientRect();\n        var tooltip = document.createElement('div');\n        tooltip.className = 'teacher-annotation';\n        tooltip.style.cssText =\n          'position:fixed; top:' + (rect.top - 40) + 'px; left:' + rect.left + 'px;' +\n          'background:rgba(139,92,246,0.95); color:white; padding:8px 12px;' +\n          'border-radius:8px; font-size:14px; z-index:1000; animation:fadeIn 0.3s;';\n        tooltip.textContent = content;\n        document.body.appendChild(tooltip);\n        setTimeout(function () { tooltip.remove(); }, 4000);\n      }\n      break;\n    case 'REVEAL_ELEMENT':\n      var revealEl = document.querySelector(target);\n      if (revealEl) {\n        revealEl.style.display = '';\n        revealEl.style.opacity = '1';\n      }\n      break;\n  }\n});\nvar bridgeStyle = document.createElement('style');\nbridgeStyle.textContent =\n  '@keyframes pulse-highlight { 0%, 100% { outline-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.8); }' +\n  ' 50% { outline-color: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); } }' +\n  '@keyframes fadeIn { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }' +\n  ' to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); } }';\ndocument.head.appendChild(bridgeStyle);\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
  },
  "actions": [
